sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant U as Customer / member
  participant T as Telegram / WhatsApp
  participant C as Caddy (HTTPS)
  participant N as n8n
  participant B as brain
  participant DB as Postgres
  participant AI as OpenAI
  Note over U,AI: A phone message
  U->>T: text or voice note
  T->>C: POST https://domain/webhook/…
  C->>N: /webhook/* (only public n8n path)
  N->>B: POST /api/channels/inbound (X-Swarm-Key)
  B->>DB: user / org / thread, knowledge search
  B->>AI: agents (master + specialists)
  AI-->>B: answer
  B-->>N: reply (empty while staff handle the chat)
  N->>T: send reply
  T-->>U: answer on their chat
  Note over U,AI: The web app
  U->>C: https://domain/
  C->>U: web app pages (from web container)
  U->>C: POST /api/agui (streamed answer)
  C->>B: /api/* (no buffering)
  B-->>U: live agent steps + answer
